      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i feel kinda gross lately. i've been drinking like way more water than usual bc im always thirsty but i'm also peeing constantly lol. also my breath smells weirdly sweet, like im eating fruit or something? i also feel kinda nauseous and tired. is this just dehydration or am i just eating too much sugar?? i really dont wana go to the doctor if i dont have to.",
